WEBVTT

00:01:00.181 --> 00:01:02.416
reality imitated caricature

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:07.459
the day Donald Trump became the President
of the United States of America.

00:01:07.483 --> 00:01:10.326
(Laughter)

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.867
(Applause)

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:18.092
You know, people come to us and they say,

00:01:18.116 --> 00:01:23.328
"It's too easy for you cartoonists.
I mean -- with people like Trump?"

00:01:23.795 --> 00:01:26.337
Well, no, it's not easy

00:01:26.361 --> 00:01:29.869
to caricature a man
who is himself a caricature.

00:01:29.893 --> 00:01:31.226
(Laughter)